Article 16

PPT PKBGA as referred to in Article 14 letter a has the duties:

a. to seek prevention;
b. to provide complaint services;
c. to provide health services;
d. to provide social rehabilitation services;
e. to provide legal assistance and law enforcement services; f. to provide repatriation and social reintegration services; g. to conduct coordination and cooperation;
h. to seek to increase community participation;
i. to conduct monitoring and reporting.

